Welcome to EatSnap AI. This Privacy Policy explains how Wenlong 
Wu ("we," "us," or "our") protects your privacy in accordance 
with Apple's App Store Guidelines and global data protection 
standards (including GDPR and CCPA).

1. Information We Collect
A. Information You Provide Directly
- Body Metrics: Gender, age, height, weight, and activity level 
  used for personalized nutritional calculations.
- Dietary Records: Food photos and text descriptions analyzed 
  by our AI to estimate calories and nutrients.
B. Information Collected Automatically
- Device Identifiers: Standard identifiers (Device Model, OS 
  version) are used to ensure app stability and manage 
  subscription status.

2. Third-Party Service Providers (SDKs)
To provide our services, we share limited, encrypted data with 
the following trusted partners:
- RevenueCat: To manage in-app subscriptions and verify your 
  Pro membership status.
- Google Firebase: For anonymous app usage statistics and crash 
  reporting to improve stability.
- Alibaba Cloud (DashScope): Our core AI engine. Food images 
  and text are transmitted via secure TLS 1.3 encryption for 
  real-time nutritional analysis.

3. AI Data Protection & Privacy
- No-Training Guarantee: We access AI models via professional 
  API channels. Your photos and dietary data are NEVER used to 
  train, retrain, or improve general AI models.
- No Commercial Sale: We do not sell, rent, or trade your 
  personal data to any third parties for marketing or 
  advertising.

4. Data Retention & International Transfer
- Temporary AI Processing: Food photos sent for AI analysis are 
  processed in transient memory and are not stored permanently 
  on our AI servers.
- Local & Cloud Storage: Your records are stored locally on 
  your device and within your private iCloud. We do not 
  maintain a central database of your personal photos.
- International Transfer: As a global service, your data may 
  be processed on secure servers located in various regions 
  where our service providers operate. All transfers are 
  protected by industry-standard encryption.

5. Your Rights & Control
- Right to Access/Delete: You can view your history at any 
  time or use the "Clear Diet History" button in Settings to 
  permanently delete all nutritional records from your device 
  and iCloud.
- Right to Limit Processing: You can choose to log food via 
  text only to avoid sharing photos.

